# Rookery Stacks (CIPlay rookery_stacks): the soup kitchen, the petition, the rats, the smithy (titanium tools), the
# tollgate, the screechers, the packer's hut (advanced backpack), three water tokens in the barrels (one on the key, two
# on the roofs), the elders' plan, their chest (electric zipline tool), the storm warning; the treasure.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Rookery Stacks
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Lowest Roofs
zone soup_kitchen
expect step 1
read Rookery petition
expect step 2
kill Rat
expect animals Rat 0
expect step 3
open Rookery smithy
wait 3
expect step 4
zone tollgate
expect step 5
kill Screecher
expect animals Screecher 0
expect step 6
open Packer's hut
wait 3
expect step 7
openat 1.65 -14.6
openat -20.6 -49.1
openat -4.8 -55.5
expect story watertoken 3
expect step 8
read Rookery elders' plan
expect step 9
open Elders' hut
wait 3
expect step 10
zone gull_stacks
expect step 11
read Bathhouse slate
expect step 12
open Family van's crate
wait 3
expect step 13
# DEEP 10-24: the notice, the climb, the dive, the boiler valve
expect hidden rk_rewchest
use rk_machine
expect hidden rk_rewchest
read Bathhouse notice
expect step 14
kill Butler bot
kill Butler bot
kill Butler bot
expect step 15
openat 37.17 -15.62
openat 18.82 -34.63
openat 28.22 -25.57
wait 3
expect story ration 3
expect step 16
zone rk_trail
expect step 17
# (the ledge cache wants a keycard)
zone rk_summit
expect step 18
expect stand 57.32 -14.63 h=34
open Great chimney deck box
wait 3
expect story rk_top 1
expect step 19
zone rk_deep
expect step 20
expect stand 25 -78 h=-16
open Bathhouse cellar strongbox
wait 3
expect story rk_deep 1
expect step 21
use rk_machine
expect shown rk_rewchest
expect story rk_fixed 1
open Boiler valve reward
wait 3
read Bathhouse ticket
expect step 22
open Glass hoard
wait 3
read Storm warning
expect done
dig
